# Pane's sections and links dragged in (#419, the owner's spec, 13 Nov 2026): a link let go on a tab
# inside a section, or on a section's header, goes into that section; one let go on the section's end
# line (┄) goes right after it, ungrouped, and one by a loose tab stays loose. Dragging the section
# itself still moves only it and its own tabs.
budget rss=800 stalls50=30
pace 0.5
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true, "showToolbar": false}

cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=1
expect-log loaded 127\.0\.0\.1 \(HTTP 200\)
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=2
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=3
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=4
wait 2
cra://debug?newSection=Mine&tabs=2
wait 0.5
cra://debug?listRows=made
expect-log list rows made: §Mine \| n=4 \| n=3 \| ┄ \| n=2 \| n=1$
# On a tab inside the section (its top quarter): into the section, before that tab.
cra://debug?dropLink=${PAGE}?n=inside&before=n=3
expect-log dropLink: opened \S*n=inside in Mine at 1$
# On the section's header: into it, at the top.
cra://debug?dropLink=${PAGE}?n=header&onto=Mine
expect-log dropLink: opened \S*n=header in Mine at 0$
# On its end line: right after the section, ungrouped.
cra://debug?dropLink=${PAGE}?n=after&endOf=Mine
expect-log dropLink: opened \S*n=after in Today at 1$
# By a loose tab: loose, before it.
cra://debug?dropLink=${PAGE}?n=loose&before=n=1
wait 1
cra://debug?todayRows=dropped
expect-log today rows dropped: §Mine\[n=header,n=4,n=inside,n=3\] \| n=after \| n=2 \| n=loose \| n=1$
# The section dragged to the end: it and its own tabs move, the links it took in with them.
cra://debug?dragRow=0&onto=8&at=0.9
wait 0.5
cra://debug?todayRows=sectionMoved
expect-log today rows sectionMoved: n=after \| n=2 \| n=loose \| n=1 \| §Mine\[n=header,n=4,n=inside,n=3\]$
reject-log fault:
